    "dialogs": {
        "dialog-cat-run-away-1": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "name": "Little Meow",
                    "text": "Meoow! Mew!"
                },
                {
                    "name": "Narrator",
                    "text": "You lean in, hands outstretched to scoop up the feline. But in a blur of fur and sheer defiance, the cat vanishes and reappearing in the far corner of the room before you can even blink. A masterful escape. He’s not half bad, this one.",
                    "color": [255, 255, 210, 255],
                    "align": "right"
                }
            ],
            "textSize": 20
        },
        "dialog-cat-run-away-2": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "name": "Little Meow",
                    "text": "Meoo-oow!"
                },
                {
                    "name": "Narrator",
                    "text": "A second attempt. You feel the sweet surge of success victory practically tingling in your fingertips—but the cat... well, the cat has other plans. With a flick of its tail, it simply vanishes, only to manifest in the opposite corner once more. Teleportation? Or just a very, very skilled feline?",
                    "color": [255, 255, 210, 255],
                    "align": "right"
                }
            ],
            "textSize": 20
        },
        "dialog-cat-run-away-final": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "name": "Little Meow",
                    "text": "Meooo... Z-z-z... Z-z-z..."
                },
                {
                    "name": "Narrator",
                    "text": "After a brief, spirited chase, the cat loses all semblance of interest in you. She curls up and drifts into a slumber. A victory for you, then? Or simply... performance? Perhaps she merely let you win to quiet your persistence. Who truly knows what lies behind those yellow eyes?",
                    "color": [255, 255, 210, 255],
                    "align": "right"
                }
            ],
            "textSize": 20
        },
